        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Detect Ollama WorkOS sign-in redirects",
        "body": "## Summary\n- detect Ollama `/signin` redirects before attempting usage parsing\n- recognize the current WorkOS AuthKit authorization destination\n- surface expired-session recovery instead of a misleading parser failure\n\n## Live proof\nRedacted live Ollama redirect chain on 2026-07-06:\n\n```text\nGET https://ollama.com/settings\nHTTP/2 303\nlocation: /signin\n\nGET https://ollama.com/signin\nHTTP/2 303\nlocation: https://api.workos.com/user_management/authorize?client_id=<redacted>&...\n```\n\nThe implementation recognizes both provider-origin URLs from this live chain. No browser cookie or Keychain access was used.\n\n## Tests\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageFetcherTests` (19 passed)\n- changed Swift files pass SwiftFormat and SwiftLint strict\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`\n\n## Commits\n- exactly 3: implementation, tests, documentation",
